<title>MALI: U.S. secretary of state starts Africa tour.</title>
<headline>U.S. secretary of state starts Africa tour.</headline>
<dateline>BAMAKO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Secretary of State Warren Christopher arrived in Mali on Monday at the start of his first visit to sub-Saharan Africa, witnesses said.</p>
<p>Christopher, who flew in from Israel and efforts to ease tension in the Middle East, will also visit Ethiopia, Tanzania, South Africa and Angola.</p>
</text>
